Reply with ONLY a JSON object: {"A": [{"n": 1, "pass": true, "reason": "..."}], "B": [{"n": 1, "pass": true, "reason": "..."}], "C": [{"n": 1, "pass": true, "reason": "..."}], "D": [{"n": 1, "pass": true, "reason": "..."}], "E": [{"n": 1, "pass": true, "reason": "..."}]}
